  "description": "The Batch 20” Kids Mountain Bike is built for young riders ready to take on the trails, climb hills, and explore off-road adventures. With a lightweight yet tough 6061 hydroformed alloy frame, this bike offers the perfect blend of durability and maneuverability, giving kids confidence as they ride.\nEquipped with a Microshift Acolyte 8-speed drivetrain, shifting is smooth and precise, while the clutch-equipped rear derailleur helps prevent chain drops on bumpy terrain. Whether navigating rocky paths or cruising through the park, the 20” x 2.6” all-condition MTB tires provide excellent grip and stability. Mechanical disc brakes with 160mm rotors ensure reliable stopping power in all weather conditions, so riders stay in control at all times.\nComfort and control come standard with MTB handlebars, ergonomic Kraton grips, and a Batch anatomical saddle, making longer rides enjoyable. Designed for adventure-seekers, the Batch 20” Kids Mountain Bike is ready to fuel new explorations—on the trail, in the neighborhood, and everywhere in between.",
